    "claim": "Confirmed challenging case on 023b7fcc: car delayed 1 s at 0.75x speed, ego at 1.4x. Every repeat failed, and the policy was at fault each time. In slow traffic it mostly steered left into car 56 in the next lane; in one repeat it sped up and ran into the slower car ahead instead. With the car slowed to 0.5x and everything else the same, the single run passed.",
